---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'; import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro'; import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="IPTV & OTT Infrastructure | Production Streaming Architecture" description="Production-ready IPTV and OTT server architecture: VPS, dedicated servers, cloud, Docker, CDN, monitoring, backup and security hardening."><PageHero eyebrow="IPTV & OTT Infrastructure" title="Production architecture without the guesswork." text="Deploy a streaming foundation that can be observed, protected, maintained and evolved as your service grows."/><section class="section"><div class="shell"><SectionHeader eyebrow="Architecture" title="Layered for performance and control." text="Each deployment is tailored to the authorized workload, operational needs and delivery footprint."/><div class="surface mt-10 overflow-hidden p-5 md:p-9"><div class="grid gap-3 text-center text-sm font-bold md:grid-cols-5"><div class="rounded-lg border border-cyan/40 bg-cyan/10 p-4 text-cyan">Ingest</div><div class="rounded-lg border border-[#31506f] bg-[#10243a] p-4 text-white">Encode / Relay</div><div class="rounded-lg border border-[#31506f] bg-[#10243a] p-4 text-white">Reverse Proxy</div><div class="rounded-lg border border-[#31506f] bg-[#10243a] p-4 text-white">Load Balance</div><div class="rounded-lg border border-cyan/40 bg-cyan/10 p-4 text-cyan">CDN Delivery</div></div><div class="my-4 border-t border-dashed border-cyan/50"></div><div class="grid gap-3 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-md bg-[#07111f] p-3">TLS / SSL</div><div class="rounded-md bg-[#07111f] p-3">Monitoring</div><div class="rounded-md bg-[#07111f] p-3">Backups</div><div class="rounded-md bg-[#07111f] p-3">Security Hardening</div></div></div><div class="prose mt-10 grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-2"><div><h2>Deployment options</h2><p>VPS, dedicated-server and cloud deployments are selected around throughput, storage, resiliency and management needs. Docker can package repeatable services and simplify controlled releases.</p><h2>Availability and delivery</h2><p>Reverse proxies, load balancing, CDN integration and high-availability patterns help create a more dependable delivery path when appropriate.</p></div><div><h2>Operate with confidence</h2><p>Monitoring, backup verification, alerting and recovery planning keep operations visible after launch. We also configure least-privilege access, TLS and practical server hardening.</p><ul><li>Capacity-aware server provisioning</li><li>Secure network and firewall configuration</li><li>Migration planning and documented handover</li></ul></div></div></div></section><CTA action="Get Infrastructure Audit"/></BaseLayout>
